ure of shooting sports park","source":"https://boisedev.com/news/2026/07/22/eagle-mulls-firearms-use-areas-future-of-shooting-sports-park/?utm_source=boisedev-email&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=boisedev-am","author":["[[Erin Banks Rusby - BoiseDev Reporter]]"],"published":"2026-07-22","created":"2026-07-23","description":"It’s business as usual, for now, for firearms use in Eagle. The Eagle City Council declined to approve an ordinance change that would have restricted the use of firearms to specific areas in the city’s foothills. In tandem, the council unanimously voted against a resolution to adopt a map designating allowed shooting areas, including a […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},